+# Encounter issue-register supplement — proposed revision 62
+
+**Status: proposed; not applied or adopted.** Supplements the historical issue register without rewriting prior issue decisions.
+
+- Throwing reference-arm and release-velocity formula decisions: covered by the proposed revision-62 consistency addendum. This only governs the mathematical reference and denominator.
+- **Still unimplemented:** native Throw Action scheduling/resolution, enforcement of the independent maximum-throwable-weight table, and connection from release velocity to the existing metric projectile trajectory calculations. No such native Throw velocity/action path was found in the inspected source.
+- **Still open independently:** ES-041 non-throwing force capacity, Grapple, grip, traction, leverage, and force-to-motion behavior.
+
+The revision-59 0.800 m formula/series and any interim 30-inch reference are historical values once the revision-62 decision is formally adopted; old dated decision records remain unchanged.
